<title>USA: Northrop Grumman jumps in NYSE opening.</title>
<headline>Northrop Grumman jumps in NYSE opening.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Northrop Grumman Corp surged 23-1/8 to 112 in their opening trade on the New York Stock Exchange following the company's proposed $11.6 billion merger deal with Lockheed Martin Corp.</p>
</text>
